entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyHDa-Q4WDEQ7kNvwFkIafy&_nc_oc=Adr5HMXj8BvT7ny-ISfLRepgJipnMrdYm6K161ZSlXrrr8_fsa9ofNSLaeW2_IEj0rY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRNQm8gICkx2mSFUO251_UidUGsNnQTCEGilL_XCDKUSQ&oe=6AFC662F"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b17FxPw1EV4Q7kNvwHYTRGS&_nc_oc=AdopmYQOHx0CAK4BnhFrdRSTW1HXzOJPZMeqQVqBCMOKqxqhinKO3ftM6NgukgGTZbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRt-EIPJu0qHpS-HYvg57AhpaKQxYQwCkZHzFWJGKcplw&oe=6AFC84AD"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jjt9Gqs_Z8oQ7kNvwF6PVRd&_nc_oc=Adpxq8-CQtsB2abGotZez9DsAkLO7WWb8sR-4jlSbwAOHsbfon8pj-jITsD0XLXiJqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHzqT-HMtD6M-YUorHtAO9RGaipn8bEED42U-KiYVwAQ&oe=6AFC7CB9"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49